      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p class="MsoNormal">KATCo's Transmisison service is administered through a Regional Transmission Organization (RTO) and requested information is not available as the individual company does not represent a distinct zone within the RTO.</p>
